# {{ title }}

Product created from the statera template (`statera new-product {{ product }}`)
{%- if alignment == 'consumer' %}, a **dissemination** product (alignment `consumer`).
{%- elif alignment == 'aggregate' %}, an **internal aggregate** product: a canonical entity read by several products, stored by cut.
{%- else %}, an **internal source** product: incremental extraction from a source system, in immutable batches.
{%- endif %}
It starts at **conformance level 0 (draft)**: validation accepts the skeleton, and `statera conformance`
shows what is missing for level 1 (catalogued). To move up a level, see the specification
(`08-conformance-levels.md`).

| Phase (GSBPM) | What goes here |
|---|---|
{%- if alignment == 'consumer' %}
| `1-specify/` | ODPS descriptor, approved classification, owners, calendar |
| `2-design/processes/` | To-be process in YAML (mirror of the BPMN), which is also the execution plan |
| `3-build/tests/` | Product tests |
| `5-process/` | Gold contracts, dbt models (marts), rules, metrics |
| `6-analyse/` | Controls (`controls.yaml`, `dbt-tests/`) |
| `7-disseminate/` | Publication series and summary template |
| `8-evaluate/` | Quality indicators and action plan |
| `queries/` | The product's recurring queries |
{%- elif alignment == 'aggregate' %}
| `1-specify/` | ODPS descriptor (with `authorizedConsumers`), approved classification, owners |
| `2-design/processes/` | To-be process: waits for the source cuts, transforms, validates and releases the cut |
| `3-build/tests/` | Product tests |
| `5-process/` | Silver contracts with `partitionedBy: cut_date`, intermediate models, rules with cases |
| `6-analyse/` | Contract checks at the cut (no statistical disclosure control: nothing is published) |
| `7-disseminate/data/<date>/cut.json` | Immutable manifest of each released cut (generated) |
| `8-evaluate/` | Service indicators (cut delay, completeness) |
{%- else %}
| `1-specify/` | ODPS descriptor (with `authorizedConsumers`), approved classification, owners |
| `2-design/processes/` | To-be process: extracts the increment, validates the load and marks the cut |
| `4-collect/contracts/` | Bronze contracts with `extraction` (source system, received-at column) and retention |
| `5-process/models/staging/` | Staging models with the `statera.at_cut` filter |
| `7-disseminate/data/<date>/cut.json` | Immutable manifest of each cut (batches and hashes; generated) |
| `8-evaluate/` | Service indicators (extraction delay, completeness) |
{%- endif %}

Update this product when the template evolves: `copier update` in this folder.
